<view class="page">
  <view class="eyebrow">ACTION COMPILER / 02</view>
  <view class="title">正在理解这条通知</view>
  <view class="muted">不是简单摘要，而是把信息编译成你的行动。</view>
  <view class="compiler-card card">
    <view class="compiler-orbit"><view class="orbit-dot"></view></view>
    <view class="compiler-label">ACTION COMPILER</view>
    <view class="loading-steps">
      <view class="loading-step" wx:for="{{steps}}" wx:key="label"><text class="step-mark {{item.done ? 'done' : ''}} {{item.active ? 'active' : ''}}">{{item.done ? '✓' : item.active ? '·' : '○'}}</text><text class="{{item.active ? 'step-active' : ''}}">{{item.label}}</text></view>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="card error-card" wx:if="{{job.error}}"><view class="danger">解析遇到问题</view><view class="muted">{{job.error.message}}</view></view>
  <view class="card" wx:if="{{canManual}}">
    <view class="title">解析失败后的人工建任务</view>
    <view class="muted">没有可靠的解析结果。只有你点击确认后，才会把自定义标题和截止时间落库。</view>
    <input value="{{manualTitle}}" placeholder="任务标题" maxlength="500" bindinput="onManualTitle" />
    <input value="{{manualDueAt}}" placeholder="截止时间（可选，如 2099-10-04T12:00:00+08:00）" bindinput="onManualDueAt" />
    <button class="button" bindtap="manualCreate">确认创建人工任务</button>
  </view>
  <view class="danger" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
</view>
